    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make Managing Your VRChat Photos Easy!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Metamory is a photo management service that automatically syncs photos taken in VRChat, allowing you to view them on your smartphone and share them with friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feature \u2460: Automatically Upload VRChat Photos!</strong><br>As soon as you take a photo in VRChat, it\u2019s automatically uploaded to Metamory!<br>You can view and share your photos from both your smartphone and PC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feature \u2461: Share Without Using Your Real Name &amp; Store About One Year\u2019s Worth of Photos for Free!</strong><br>With Metamory, you can share photos using your usual VRChat username\u2014no need to use your real name!<br>You can also store up to 1,000 photos (about one year's worth) for free.<br>(*Upgrading to a paid plan is required for additional storage.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feature \u2462: Automatically Detect &amp; Tag People in Photos!</strong><br>Metamory automatically identifies and tags users who were in the same instance when a photo was taken.<br>You can search for photos by who appears in them, and easily look back on shared moments with friends!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make Managing Your VRChat Photos Easy!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Metamory is a photo management service that automatically syncs photos taken in VRChat, allowing you to view them on your smartphone and share them with friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feature \u2460: Automatically Upload VRChat Photos!</strong><br>As soon as you take a photo in VRChat, it\u2019s automatically uploaded to Metamory!<br>You can view and share your photos from both your smartphone and PC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feature \u2461: Share Without Using Your Real Name &amp; Store About One Year\u2019s Worth of Photos for Free!</strong><br>With Metamory, you can share photos using your usual VRChat username\u2014no need to use your real name!<br>You can also store up to 1,000 photos (about one year's worth) for free.<br>(*Upgrading to a paid plan is required for additional storage.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feature \u2462: Automatically Detect &amp; Tag People in Photos!</strong><br>Metamory automatically identifies and tags users who were in the same instance when a photo was taken.<br>You can search for photos by who appears in them, and easily look back on shared moments with friends!</p>",
